msgid ""
"If you have an APM 2 with the built-in Mediatek GPS and would like to use an"
" external and/or different GPS module, you can do so with some simple "
"modifications:"
msgstr "如果您的APM 2带有内置Mediatek GPS，希望改用外部或其他GPS模块，可通过一些简单改动实现："

#: ../../source/docs/common-disabling-the-built-in-gps-on-apm2-to-use-an-external-gps-instead.rst:17
#: dcd7025cb7254d5786f0c6dae1902dfa
msgid "Just solder a blob over these two pins, to short them out:"
msgstr "只需在这两个引脚上焊锡将其短接即可："

#: ../../source/docs/common-disabling-the-built-in-gps-on-apm2-to-use-an-external-gps-instead.rst:23
#: 450719ee40d34216b12a8b3c5543a11f
msgid "Testing"
msgstr "测试"

#: ../../source/docs/common-disabling-the-built-in-gps-on-apm2-to-use-an-external-gps-instead.rst:25
#: ae9423f167144994b16fac4d42e8d91a
msgid ""
"With no external GPS, connect to APM via the Mission Planner. The HUD should"
" report \"No GPS\". That's good -- it means it can't detect a GPS module. "
"Now disconnect and remove the power from your board/remove the USB cable"
msgstr ""
"不连接外置GPS，通过Mission Planner连接APM。HUD应报告「No "
"GPS」。这是好事——说明检测不到GPS模块。现在断开连接并从板上断开电源/拔出USB线"

#: ../../source/docs/common-disabling-the-built-in-gps-on-apm2-to-use-an-external-gps-instead.rst:29
#: 7d8106ecfd2f4d91923409c240f69d47
msgid "Connect your external GPS to the GPS port"
msgstr "将外置GPS连接到GPS接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-disabling-the-built-in-gps-on-apm2-to-use-an-external-gps-instead.rst:30
#: 0d2f1c4ddd124501a7313dba5d2701ac
msgid "Connect the USB cable and connect via the Mission Planner again"
msgstr "插入USB线并再次通过Mission Planner连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-disabling-the-built-in-gps-on-apm2-to-use-an-external-gps-instead.rst:31
#: f16287d47dd649fba9d7259cc14d6541
msgid ""
"Once it connects, it should report \"No Fix\" (if you're indoors or don't "
"have a fix yet) or \"3D Fix\" (if you've got GPS fix). Either are great -- "
"it means your new GPS was detected!"
msgstr "连接后，应报告「No Fix」（若在室内或尚未定位）或「3D Fix」（若已获得GPS定位）。两者均可——说明新GPS已被检测到！"
